{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IJSkyR3rNC1795145941.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有分析相信，受外圍科技股拖累，港股不排除下試22,000點，甚至更低水平。</p><p></p><p>高歌證券金融首席分析師聶振邦指出：「現時已重返2025年4月下旬位置，當時有幾天橫行狀況，大概在22,000點水平，對應現時來說，差距大概500多點。後市就要看美國科技股會否有靠穩跡象，若沒靠穩跡象，我想傾向上有心理準備，可能22,000點也未必守得到，就有繼續下行狀況。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:43:54.266419+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T03:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T04:57:14.513945+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T04:37:17.588423+00:00","content_hash":"1fa82e83064ac14996e1ac03b8a5b7b1114b4729afa3eb0cc081026229865bf8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:43:54.266419+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}